# Auto commit + push for Vercel

After finishing any code change in this project (unless the user explicitly says not to):

1. Create a git commit with a clear message matching the repo style.
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD`) so Vercel redeploys.
3. Do this without waiting for the user to ask for a commit or push.
4. Follow the existing git safety protocol (no force push, no amend unless required, no secrets).
5. Briefly tell the user the commit was pushed and Vercel will update.
